rule top_cover v1
description "What a parcel is insured for: twice the price of its dearest line, and the price of its cheapest line wrapped as a gift (0 yen where no line is wrapped). The insurer takes a cover from 100 yen to 60,000 yen, and insures a parcel from 10,000 yen"

# one line of the parcel
elements lines
  price : money[JPY]  range >=0JPY <=50_000JPY
  gift  : bool

sum total over lines of price  range >=0JPY <=100_000JPY
max highest over lines of price empty 0JPY
min lowest over lines of price where gift empty 0JPY

define cover : money[JPY] = highest * 2 + lowest  range >=100JPY <=60_000JPY

outputs
  insured : bool

table insure
policy unique
| cover       | -> insured |
| <10_000JPY  | false      |
| >=10_000JPY | true       |
